Description: Tasksheet plugin for the Diodon clipboard manager
 Adds a Tasksheet next to Diodon's clipboard history: a personal list of
 words and notes. Items are moved from the clipboard to the tasksheet with a
 button or by drag and drop, tasks can be typed in directly, and a click
 copies a task back to the clipboard.
 .
 The plugin appears in Diodon's preferences (Plugins) and adds a
 "Tasksheet..." entry to Diodon's menu. The diodon-tasksheet command opens
 the popup from keyboard shortcuts (GNOME shortcuts for Super+V and Super+Y
 can be set up with "diodon-tasksheet hotkeys").
 .
 It uses only Diodon's public plugin interface and does not modify Diodon.
